  {
   "name": "playthrough_l1_to_l4",
   "_": "Solve levels 1, 2, 3, 4 in sequence. Level\u2192level transition takes ~4 ticks (compute\u2192win\u2192reset\u2192count chain). L1: 1E. L2: 4E+S+3W+S+3E (12). L3: 3E+S+3W+3S+3E+N+2W (16). L4: 2E+S+3W+S+2E (9). Verify advance to level 5.",
