  {
   "name": "wall_blocks_push_at_perimeter_l2",
   "_": "Win level 1, then on level 2 push B1 east 5 times. 4 pushes land B1 on G1 at (208,80). 5th push target (240,80) is perimeter wall \u2014 must NOT push B1 to (240). All boxes in level 2 must stay at x <= 208 (col 6 = G1 column = rightmost in-bounds).",
   "setup": {},
